            <body>Rationale: A full pallet must be secured while palletising continues without waiting. Source: UC16. Feature: FIN-FEAT-15. (Applies to FIN-REQ-28.1, FIN-REQ-28.2.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_4G59Au3veS5MPm5Tn_kW90" name="FIN-REQ-28.2"/>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_AqULhGVOWR0tPVrJzNxtAN" name="FIN-REQ-29">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_jdDNAMRiErbujy1XeW4qJ2" annotatedElement="_AqULhGVOWR0tPVrJzNxtAN">
            <body>Rationale: Secures the pallet for transport. Source: UC16. Feature: FIN-FEAT-15. (Applies to FIN-REQ-29.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_z79hB79Wy28QYsIfkZjaD2" name="FIN-REQ-30">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_Y63ccegtFm1njgnr998Uhr" annotatedElement="_z79hB79Wy28QYsIfkZjaD2">
            <body>Rationale: Hands the pallet to Production &amp; Logistics; batch IDs keep traceability intact. Source: UC16. Feature: FIN-FEAT-15. (Applies to FIN-REQ-30.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="_LMcKgM4LEfGJpPDutUy9XQ" name="RD6 Pan Washing and Verification">
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_VHlw6s5wWOroxjtBhYeNvu" name="FIN-REQ-11.1">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_qCBttJkXKBydddGIz7SqOL" annotatedElement="_VHlw6s5wWOroxjtBhYeNvu _vglFU9leuBZHYyEBrxKbg2 _Ir6zOKRuhlXHz-6q9rMs_l">
            <body>Rationale: Only fit pans may re-enter production. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-17. (Applies to FIN-REQ-11.1, FIN-REQ-11.2, FIN-REQ-11.3.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_vglFU9leuBZHYyEBrxKbg2" name="FIN-REQ-11.2"/>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_Ir6zOKRuhlXHz-6q9rMs_l" name="FIN-REQ-11.3"/>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_P9U0OSDRlCCy2XaflpZPEI" name="FIN-REQ-12.1">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_r5ju-5FGMoHzumeWPWtPBZ" annotatedElement="_P9U0OSDRlCCy2XaflpZPEI _kEosNeLJvFZJX_ucvqIDIT">
            <body>Rationale: Keeps the pan loop supplied and keeps damaged or dirty pans out of production. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-17. (Applies to FIN-REQ-12.1, FIN-REQ-12.2.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_kEosNeLJvFZJX_ucvqIDIT" name="FIN-REQ-12.2"/>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_ZFgE0_FbvIY3nXCZY72Co5" name="FIN-REQ-13">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_AQULvs9dvdemNpdaDWxpng" annotatedElement="_ZFgE0_FbvIY3nXCZY72Co5">
            <body>Rationale: The pan count must be kept up to date for the pan-stock rule. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-17. (Applies to FIN-REQ-13.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_KBvwNsmJ8VpoAuXnm-sMkb" name="FIN-REQ-15">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_3aBBM_Pip_dac85gtsYdzn" annotatedElement="_KBvwNsmJ8VpoAuXnm-sMkb">
            <body>Rationale: Pans diverted after a wrong fill weight must be cleaned and reused. Source: UC12, FC9. Feature: FIN-FEAT-17. (Applies to FIN-REQ-15.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
      </packagedElement>
      <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Package" xmi:id="_MZP74M4LEfGJpPDutUy9XQ" name="RD7 Pan Stock and Washing Catch-up">
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_fzjVj-zG5eISJVAG7_rr0x" name="FIN-REQ-14">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_W978nj6mM6l93eyL9kCqoS" annotatedElement="_fzjVj-zG5eISJVAG7_rr0x">
            <body>Rationale: Business rule: a backlog of one full production system of clean pans must always exist. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-18. (Applies to FIN-REQ-14.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_iTANEBhAxQFknjLLlzjkXn" name="FIN-REQ-16">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_NJ8Y3vijYtFaYk8e1yN6bZ" annotatedElement="_iTANEBhAxQFknjLLlzjkXn">
            <body>Rationale: Depositing must not stall for lack of a pan. Source: FC8. Feature: FIN-FEAT-18. (Applies to FIN-REQ-16.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_HlNfyeG6hf9qIJ8iDc574W" name="FIN-REQ-17">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_5XF7lHf0EKIvBlj4cMqlfq" annotatedElement="_HlNfyeG6hf9qIJ8iDc574W">
            <body>Rationale: Lets depositing fill fewer pans when stock runs low. Source: UC12, FC23. Feature: FIN-FEAT-18. (Applies to FIN-REQ-17.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_pIHZcsDH6MkCySFwkeSLX1" name="FIN-REQ-18">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_oyrVumOZ8VKRdnbpefiPGf" annotatedElement="_pIHZcsDH6MkCySFwkeSLX1">
            <body>Rationale: Availability: the pan pool buffers short outages of the washing station. Source: FC23. Feature: FIN-FEAT-18. (Applies to FIN-REQ-18.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_CEdf-8EELEyxyArrv-_ve0" name="FIN-REQ-19">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_5dJa5UMl7vEQqT0567AT2J" annotatedElement="_CEdf-8EELEyxyArrv-_ve0">
            <body>Rationale: Prevents restarting the washing station in an unsafe state. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-19. (Applies to FIN-REQ-19.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
        <packagedElement xmi:type="uml:Class" xmi:id="_rmYaREz-Gh6qcl-fKelylI" name="FIN-REQ-20.1">
          <ownedComment xmi:type="uml:Comment" xmi:id="_HDIh6xr2uPvb1fqp4d1d3G" annotatedElement="_rmYaREz-Gh6qcl-fKelylI _tZhljRxha7i50u6Ie0OwsI _D5JvFN9sdwUAbwnierFWsA">
            <body>Rationale: Recovers the pan backlog after a washing-station fault without running fast longer than needed. Source: UC12. Feature: FIN-FEAT-19. (Applies to FIN-REQ-20.1, FIN-REQ-20.2, FIN-REQ-20.3.)</body>
          </ownedComment>
        </packagedElement>
